  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Our core product, the One Metric Journal, is not a basic notebook.<br>It’s a structured system designed to help people:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Build discipline</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Break bad habits</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Track performance</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Increase self-awareness</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Take control of their life</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The journal includes:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Truth Mapping system</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>21-Day Habit Tracking cycles</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Daily structure for clarity and focus</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Self-reflection prompts</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Performance tracking pages</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This is not stationery.<br>It’s a transformation tool.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">System-Based, Not Motivational<br>Most journals rely on quotes.<br>Ours is built around structured behaviour change.</span></p><ol><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Identity-Driven Brand<br>We focus on control, discipline, and transformation — not soft productivity.</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>High Aesthetic Standard<br>Premium materials, minimal design, clean packaging.<br>Designed to feel serious and intentional.</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Emotional Positioning<br>We don’t sell paper.<br>We sell clarity, structure, and control.</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Strong Growth Phase<br>We are actively scaling and prioritising affiliates as a core growth channel.</p></li></ol><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This is early-stage momentum.<br>Affiliates joining now grow with us.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We operate a high-reward commission structure.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Base commission: 30% per sale</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Top performers (volume-based): Up to 35%</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Example:<br>If you sell 20 journals at £32.99:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">30% commission = £9.90 per unit<br>20 sales = £198 commission</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">No caps.<br>No limits.<br>Performance-based upgrades available.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">You can promote using:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">✔ Instagram (Reels, Stories, Bio Link)<br>✔ TikTok<br>✔ YouTube<br>✔ Email lists<br>✔ Blogs<br>✔ Community groups<br>✔ Accountability communities<br>✔ Fitness / discipline content</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We are currently in a growth expansion phase with limited stock.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Our goal is to scale through strong partnerships and word-of-mouth.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Top affiliates may receive:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Early access to new product drops</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Increased commission tiers</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Exclusive collaborations</p></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;\"><p>Free product samples for content creation</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We value long-term partnerships over one-time promotions.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">If you believe in discipline, growth, and self-mastery —<br>this is a brand your audience will resonate with.</span></p></div></div>",
